        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Writers tend to think their writing is clearer than their readers do. Select a page of your writing and share it with a reader. Both of you rate its clarity on a scale of 1–10, with 10 being perfectly clear and 1 being incomprehensible. Use the procedures for analyzing sentences on pp. 32–33 to explain any differences in your ratings. Revise your writing if necessary.",
